OL,3,GNEWSASaving water must be year-round
OL,4,Anot just summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FSaving water at home needs to be
OL,7,Fhappening all year-round to secure our
OL,8,Ffuture supplies not just during the
OL,9,Fprolonged dry and hot summers, experts
OL,10,Fsay.
OL,12,FAt the end of July, the Environment
OL,13,FAgency declared more than half of
OL,14,FEngland as being in drought and on
OL,15,FThursday it was escalated to severe
OL,16,Fdrought for parts of Cornwall, Devon,
OL,17,FDorset, Somerset, East Sussex, and West
OL,18,FSussex.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
