OL,3,GNEWSASaving water must be year-round
OL,4,Anot just summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Devon campaign group and a water
OL,7,Fengineer said this highlights the need
OL,8,Ffor behavioural change to prevent
OL,9,Fwasting water at home.
OL,11,FThe average person in the UK uses about
OL,12,F139 (34 gallons) litres of water per
OL,13,Fday.
